{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24029","headline":"酬思黯相公见过弊居戏赠 · 白居易","name":"酬思黯相公见过弊居戏赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"轩盖光照地，行人爲裴回。\n呼传君子出，乃是故人来。\n访我入穷巷，引君登小台。\n台前多竹树，池上无尘埃。\n贫家何所有，新酒三两桮。\n停杯欵曲语，上马复迟回。\n留守不外宿，日斜宫漏催。\n但留金刀赠，未接玉山颓。\n家酝不敢惜，待君来即开。\n邨妓不辞出，恐君冁然咍。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24029.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24029","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}